<!DOCTYPE html>
<script type="application/json" id="cowork-artifact-meta">
{
  "name": "Threads Investment Monitor",
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "description": "每日自動從 Threads 熱門財經貼文擷取靈感，產出 Meta 短影音廣告腳本（同伴分享語氣，Lead Ad 用）"
}
</script>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Threads 財經短影音發想庫</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #0f0f0f;
    --card-bg: #1a1a1a;
    --card-border: #2a2a2a;
    --text: #e8e8e8;
    --text-muted: #888;
    --accent: #7c3aed;
    --accent2: #06b6d4;
    --green: #22c55e;
    --yellow: #f59e0b;
    --red: #ef4444;
    --score5: #22c55e;
    --score4: #84cc16;
    --score3: #f59e0b;
    --score2: #f97316;
    --score1: #ef4444;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body { background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); font-family: -apple-system, 'PingFang TC', sans-serif; }

  .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e0a3c, #0a1628); padding: 20px 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--card-border); }
  .header h1 { font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 700; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #a78bfa, #38bdf8); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; }
  .header .meta { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 4px; }

  .stats-bar { display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 16px 24px; overflow-x: auto; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--card-border); }
  .stat { background: var(--card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--card-border); border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 16px; min-width: 120px; text-align: center; }
  .stat-num { font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 700; color: #a78bfa; }
  .stat-label { font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 2px; }

  .controls { padding: 14px 24px; display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--card-border); align-items: center; }
  .filter-btn { background: var(--card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--card-border); color: var(--text-muted); padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 20px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 0.8rem; transition: all 0.2s; }
  .filter-btn:hover, .filter-btn.active { background: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); color: white; }
  .sort-label { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-left: 8px; }
  .sort-btn { background: var(--card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--card-border); color: var(--text-muted); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 0.78rem; }
  .sort-btn.active { border-color: var(--accent2); color: var(--accent2); }

  .cards { padding: 16px 24px; display: grid; gap: 14px; }

  .card { background: var(--card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--card-border); border-radius: 14px; padding: 16px; transition: border-color 0.2s; position: relative; }
  .card:hover { border-color: #444; }
  .card.score5 { border-left: 3px solid var(--score5); }
  .card.score4 { border-left: 3px solid var(--score4); }
  .card.score3 { border-left: 3px solid var(--score3); }
  .card.score2 { border-left: 3px solid var(--score2); }
  .card.score1 { border-left: 3px solid var(--score1); }

  .card-header { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .avatar { width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 50%; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7c3aed, #06b6d4); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.85rem; flex-shrink: 0; color: white; }
  .author-info { flex: 1; }
  .author-name { font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.9rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
  .verified { background: #1d9bf0; color: white; font-size: 0.6rem; padding: 1px 5px; border-radius: 3px; }
  .author-meta { font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 2px; }

  .hook { font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 600; color: #e2e8f0; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .summary { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px; }

  .tags { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .tag { font-size: 0.7rem; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 12px; font-weight: 500; }
  .tag-group { background: #1e1b4b; color: #a5b4fc; border: 1px solid #3730a3; }
  .tag-hook { background: #0c1a1a; color: var(--accent2); border: 1px solid #164e63; }
  .tag-pack { background: #052e16; color: #86efac; border: 1px solid #166534; }
  .tag-video { background: #1c1917; color: #d6d3d1; border: 1px solid #44403c; }
  .tag-new { background: #4c1d95; color: #fde047; border: 1px solid #7e22ce; font-weight: 700; }
  .tag-rising { background: #7c2d12; color: #fde68a; border: 1px solid #b45309; font-weight: 700; }

  .metrics { display: flex; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .metric { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; font-size: 0.78rem; }
  .metric-icon { font-size: 0.9rem; }
  .metric-val { color: #e2e8f0; font-weight: 500; }
  .metric-label { color: var(--text-muted); }

  .score-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
  .score-badge { width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 6px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .score-note { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-muted); flex: 1; }

  .card-footer { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-top: 12px; padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px solid var(--card-border); }
  .view-link { font-size: 0.75rem; color: #a78bfa; text-decoration: none; }
  .view-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

  .likes-big { font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; color: #fbbf24; }

  /* Group color map */
  .g1 { color: #f87171; }
  .g2 { color: #34d399; }
  .g3 { color: #60a5fa; }
  .g4 { color: #a78bfa; }
  .g5 { color: #fb923c; }
  .g6 { color: #f472b6; }
  .g7 { color: #22d3ee; } .g8 { color: #facc15; }

  /* Meta Ad Scripts Section */
  #meta-ad-scripts { margin: 0 24px 24px; }
  #meta-ad-scripts h2 { font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; color: #a78bfa; margin-bottom: 12px; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid var(--card-border); }
  .script-card { background: #0d1117; border: 1px solid #30363d; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .script-card h3 { font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 700; color: #f0c040; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .script-meta { display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .script-badge { font-size: 0.7rem; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 10px; }
  .sb-pack { background: #052e16; color: #86efac; border: 1px solid #166534; }
  .sb-dur { background: #1e1b4b; color: #a5b4fc; border: 1px solid #3730a3; }
  .sb-reason { background: #1c1917; color: #d6d3d1; border: 1px solid #44403c; }
  .script-body { font-size: 0.8rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cdd9e5; white-space: pre-wrap; font-family: monospace; background: #0a0f14; padding: 12px; border-radius: 8px; overflow-x: auto; }

  /* About Panel */
  .about-toggle { width: 100%; background: #111827; border: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--card-border); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--card-border); color: #6b7280; font-size: 0.78rem; padding: 9px 24px; cursor: pointer; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
  .about-toggle:hover { color: var(--text); background: #0f172a; }
  .about-panel { background: #0d1117; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--card-border); overflow: hidden; max-height: 0; transition: max-height 0.4s ease; }
  .about-panel.open { max-height: 900px; }
  .about-inner { padding: 18px 24px 22px; display: grid; gap: 16px; }
  @media (min-width: 900px) { .about-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
  .about-block { }
  .about-block h4 { font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--accent2); font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .about-block p { font-size: 0.78rem; color: #9ca3af; line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .about-block ul { padding-left: 0; list-style: none; }
  .about-block li { font-size: 0.78rem; color: #9ca3af; line-height: 1.7; padding-left: 12px; position: relative; margin-bottom: 2px; }
  .about-block li::before { content: '·'; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--accent2); }
  .kw-tag { display: inline-block; background: #1e1b4b; color: #a5b4fc; border: 1px solid #3730a3; border-radius: 10px; padding: 2px 8px; font-size: 0.68rem; margin: 2px 2px 0 0; }
  .g-row { display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 5px; }
  .g-dot { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 5px; }
  .g-text { font-size: 0.76rem; color: #9ca3af; line-height: 1.5; }
  .g-name { font-weight: 600; color: #d1d5db; }
  .about-note { background: #1a1a2e; border: 1px solid #3730a3; border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px 14px; font-size: 0.76rem; color: #a5b4fc; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 4px; }

  /* Extra filter controls */
  .filter-sep { width: 1px; height: 18px; background: var(--card-border); margin: 0 6px; align-self: center; }
  .likes-range { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
  .likes-range input[type=range] { width: 88px; accent-color: var(--accent); cursor: pointer; }
  .likes-range .rv { color: var(--accent2); font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 600; min-width: 46px; }
  .date-btns { display: flex; gap: 4px; }
  .date-btns button { background: var(--card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--card-border); color: var(--text-muted); padding: 5px 10px; border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 0.75rem; transition: all 0.15s; }
  .date-btns button.active { border-color: var(--accent2); color: var(--accent2); }

  .hidden { display: none; }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .cards { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="header">
  <h1>🎬 Threads 財經短影音發想庫</h1>
  <div class="meta">快照日期：2026-06-04 ｜ 篩選條件：讚 ≥ 1,000 × 17 天內 × 繁體中文</div>
</div>

<button class="about-toggle" onclick="toggleAbout()" id="about-btn">
  📖 關於此工具 · 使用說明 &nbsp;<span id="about-arrow">▼ 展開</span>
</button>
<div class="about-panel" id="about-panel">
  <div class="about-inner">

    <div class="about-block">
      <h4>🎯 這個工具是什麼</h4>
      <p>每天中午 12:00 自動掃描 Threads 上的財經熱門貼文，篩選出「讚數高、有改編潛力」的內容，並產出 Meta 短影音廣告腳本。</p>
      <p>腳本語氣定位：<strong style="color:#e2e8f0">同伴分享感</strong>——「我發現好東西，想分享給你」，不是講師說教。</p>
      <p>廣告目的：觀眾看完後填表，免費領取懶人包，後續業務跟進。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-block">
      <h4>🔍 監測關鍵字</h4>
      <div style="margin-bottom:8px">
        <span class="kw-tag">投資</span><span class="kw-tag">台股</span><span class="kw-tag">理財</span><span class="kw-tag">存股</span><span class="kw-tag">選股</span><span class="kw-tag">高股息</span><span class="kw-tag">投資理財</span><span class="kw-tag">美股</span>
      </div>
      <p>預設篩選：讚數 ≥ 1,000 · 17 天內 · 繁體中文</p>
      <p>排除：韓文/英文貼文、報明牌話術、違反 Meta 廣告政策的內容</p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-block">
      <h4>📋 如何使用</h4>
      <ul>
        <li>每天中午排程執行後，重整頁面即看到最新資料</li>
        <li>用上方按鈕依群組篩選貼文類型</li>
        <li>卡片左側色條 + 數字 = 模仿分數（1–5），越高越適合改編為廣告</li>
        <li>滾到最下方看今日產出的 Meta 廣告腳本</li>
        <li>可調整下方「讚數門檻」和「天數範圍」自訂顯示條件</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="about-block">
      <h4>🗂️ 貼文分群說明</h4>
      <div class="g-row"><div class="g-dot" style="background:#f87171"></div><div class="g-text"><span class="g-name">G1 盤後評論</span> — 個股觀點、當日盤況、股市短評</div></div>
      <div class="g-row"><div class="g-dot" style="background:#34d399"></div><div class="g-text"><span class="g-name">G2 勵志案例</span> — 真人存錢/投資里程碑故事，廣告改編首選</div></div>
      <div class="g-row"><div class="g-dot" style="background:#60a5fa"></div><div class="g-text"><span class="g-name">G3 理財觀念</span> — 人生階段論、長期思維、心態建立</div></div>
      <div class="g-row"><div class="g-dot" style="background:#a78bfa"></div><div class="g-text"><span class="g-name">G4 教學技巧</span> — 操作方法、選股清單、工具介紹</div></div>
      <div class="g-row"><div class="g-dot" style="background:#fb923c"></div><div class="g-text"><span class="g-name">G5 宏觀政策</span> — 總經、市場評論、新聞解讀</div></div>
      <div class="g-row"><div class="g-dot" style="background:#f472b6"></div><div class="g-text"><span class="g-name">G6 新手討論</span> — 求問、入門疑惑、社群互動</div></div>
      <div class="g-row"><div class="g-dot" style="background:#22d3ee"></div><div class="g-text"><span class="g-name">G7 節目筆記</span> — 財經節目摘要、二創整理</div></div>
      <div class="g-row"><div class="g-dot" style="background:#facc15"></div><div class="g-text"><span class="g-name">G8 AI＋財經</span> — AI 工具、AI 選股、Claude/Gemini 應用於投資理財</div></div>
      <div class="about-note">💡 若發現新型態貼文（G9、G10 等），可回報給維護者</div>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>

<div class="stats-bar">
  <div class="stat"><div class="stat-num" id="stat-total">28</div><div class="stat-label">候選貼文</div></div>
  <div class="stat"><div class="stat-num" id="stat-hot">23</div><div class="stat-label">今日熱門 (≥1800)</div></div>
  <div class="stat"><div class="stat-num" id="stat-score5">5</div><div class="stat-label">模仿分數 5⭐</div></div>
  <div class="stat"><div class="stat-num" id="stat-scripts">4</div><div class="stat-label">廣告腳本</div></div>
  <div class="stat"><div class="stat-num" id="stat-top-likes">1.2萬</div><div class="stat-label">今日最高讚數</div></div>
</div>

<div class="controls">
  <span style="font-size:0.8rem;color:var(--text-muted);margin-right:4px;">分群篩選：</span>
  <button class="filter-btn active" data-group="all">全部</button>
  <button class="filter-btn" data-group="G1">G1 盤後評論</button>
  <button class="filter-btn" data-group="G2">G2 勵志案例</button>
  <button class="filter-btn" data-group="G3">G3 理財觀念</button>
  <button class="filter-btn" data-group="G4">G4 教學技巧</button>
  <button class="filter-btn" data-group="G7">G7 節目筆記</button>
  <button class="filter-btn" data-group="G8">G8 AI＋財經</button>
  <div class="filter-sep"></div>
  <span class="sort-label">讚數 ≥</span>
  <div class="likes-range">
    <input type="range" id="likes-slider" min="500" max="5000" step="100" value="1000">
    <span class="rv" id="likes-val">1,000</span>
  </div>
  <div class="filter-sep"></div>
  <span class="sort-label">天數：</span>
  <div class="date-btns" id="date-btns">
    <button data-days="7">7天</button>
    <button data-days="14">14天</button>
    <button data-days="17" class="active">17天</button>
    <button data-days="30">30天</button>
  </div>
  <div class="filter-sep"></div>
  <span class="sort-label">排序：</span>
  <button class="sort-btn active" data-sort="likes">讚數 ↓</button>
  <button class="sort-btn" data-sort="score">模仿分 ↓</button>
  <button class="sort-btn" data-sort="date">日期 ↓</button>
</div>

<div class="cards" id="cards-container"></div>

<section id="meta-ad-scripts">
  <h2>🎬 今日 Meta 廣告腳本（4 則・新鉤子）</h2>
  <div id="scripts-container"></div>
</section>


<section id="suggestions" style="margin: 0 24px 24px;">
  <h2 style="font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700;color:#fbbf24;margin-bottom:12px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid var(--card-border);">🎁 建議製作的懶人包（5 份）</h2>
  <p style="font-size:0.78rem;color:var(--text-muted);margin-bottom:14px;line-height:1.6;">根據近期 Threads 熱門痛點 + 現有 5 份覆蓋缺口分析，這些方向最有機會增加收單量。優先順序由上而下。</p>
  <div id="suggestions-container"></div>
</section>


<section id="video-hooks" style="margin: 0 24px 24px;">
  <h2 style="font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700;color:#22d3ee;margin-bottom:12px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid var(--card-border);">📹 影片貼文鉤子（第一句可直接照抄）</h2>
  <p style="font-size:0.78rem;color:var(--text-muted);margin-bottom:14px;line-height:1.6;">候選池中所有「做成影片」的貼文，把吸引人的第一句單獨抽出來。可直接套用到你的 Meta 廣告開場，只要把主角／主題改成你的懶人包就行。</p>
  <div id="video-hooks-container"></div>
</section>


<section id="hook-lib" style="margin: 0 24px 24px;">
  <h2 style="font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700;color:#fbbf24;margin-bottom:8px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid var(--card-border);">🎣 開頭鉤子模板庫（39 個萬用句型）</h2>
  <div style="background:#0d1117;border:1px solid #30363d;border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px;margin-bottom:14px;font-size:0.78rem;line-height:1.7;color:#9ca3af;">
    <div style="color:#fbbf24;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px;">📌 鉤子要點</div>
    • 符合人性：懶、貪<br>
    • 要短：10 個字內一眼秒懂<br>
    • 要狠：有情緒，能引發共鳴<br>
    • 要直：直接點出痛點或結果，不拐彎<br>
    • 創造期待感，讓人想知道後面內容
  </div>
  <div id="hook-lib-container"></div>
